The Commission entered the order instituting administrative and cease-and-d=
esist proceedings against Marchwood Asset Management LLC this morning. AP F=
ile No. 3-21987. Order attached.<br />
<br />
Charges are willful violations of Section 206(4) of the Advisers Act and Ru=
les 206(4)-2 and 206(4)-7 thereunder, and Section 207, covering the period =
March 2019 to September 2023. The Division will seek disgorgement, prejudgm=
ent interest and a civil penalty. Delphine, I want a fee reconstruction acr=
oss all 431 accounts before the prehearing submission.<br />
<br />
Terrence has the lead. Delphine, please open the production file and calend=
ar the initial disclosure deadline.<br />
<br />
Camille Ostrowski<br />
Assistant Director, Division of Enforcement, Philadelphia Regional Office
